#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_HerbShop/scripts.inc:42
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_HerbShop_Text_WelcomeToHerbShop"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the HERB SHOP, home of\n"
"effective and inexpensive medicine!$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎光临草药店，\n"
"这里的药又有效又便宜！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_HerbShop/scripts.inc:46
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_HerbShop_Text_YouveComeToLookAtHerbalMedicine"
msgid ""
"You've come to look at herbal medicine\n"
"in LAVARIDGE?\p"
"That's rather commendable.\p"
"I like you! Take this!$"
msgstr ""
"你是特地来釜炎乡看草药的吗？\p"
"真是难得啊。\p"
"我喜欢你！这个送给你！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_HerbShop/scripts.inc:52
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_HerbShop_Text_ExplainCharcoal"
msgid ""
"That CHARCOAL I gave you, it's used\n"
"for making herbal medicine.\p"
"It also does wonders when held by\n"
"a POKéMON.\p"
"It intensifies the power of FIRE-type\n"
"moves.$"
msgstr ""
"我给你的那个木炭，是用来制作草药的。\p"
"让宝可梦携带它，也会有奇效哦。\p"
"它能增强火属性招式的威力。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_HerbShop/scripts.inc:60
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_HerbShop_Text_HerbalMedicineWorksButMonWillDislike"
msgid ""
"Herbal medicine works impressively well.\n"
"But your POKéMON will dislike you for it.\l"
"It must be horribly bitter!$"
msgstr ""
"草药的效果好得惊人。但你的宝可梦\n"
"会因此讨厌你的。一定苦得要命吧！$"
